SupraLINUX KGuiAddons packaging
==============================

Authority is KDE upstream stable. The Debian 6.28 packaging tree retained by
SupraLINUX is used only as a technical package-layout/symbols/copyright
reference.

Batch 8 preserves KDE 6.30 Linux defaults, including Wayland, X11, DBus, the
geo URI helper, Python bindings and tests. QCH remains disabled by the common
SupraLINUX Frameworks packaging profile.

KGuiAddons remains Tier 1: KCoreAddons is not a Build-Depends. The public
KImageCache header includes KCoreAddons' kshareddatacache.h, so the -dev binary
package depends on libkf6coreaddons-dev and the consumer smoke validates that
surface against the retained SupraLINUX KCoreAddons PASS.
